    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=606 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/587bd2c60dcaa0ceec75c5aa2b747849.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most played mobile simulation game in the world, <strong>Bus Simulator : Ultimate</strong>, PC version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 Official Mercedes-Benz, Setra and Scania licensed buses are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the greatest bus company ever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most downloaded simulation bus game by over 350+ million users! Establish your bus company and become the largest bus corporation in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>United States, United Kingdom, China, Canada, Russia, Germany, Italy, France, Spain, Netherlands, Turkey, South Korea, Japan, Brazil, Azerbaijan, Belgium, Bulgaria, Saudi Arabia, United Emirates, Czech Republic, Dominican Republic, Indonesia, Philippines, South Africa, India, Hong Kong, Ireland, Israel, Qatar, Malaysia, Thailand, Taiwan and more Realistic city maps and bus stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/ccc2d456391859edf57ff88034e76491.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=726 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While passengers rest at the rest area, you can wash your bus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/2602932fedf364aa47a36e10f883d784.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=726 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will experience real bus driving with highly detailed bus cockpits designed down to the finest detail.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/87bcc2e043f69a0bc38b69e42a810d3a.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to have offices in many places around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 thousand cities and counties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passenger System will provide Social and Realistic Reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your own business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees and manage your company for maximum profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32+ Amazing Coach Bus (Mercedes-Benz, Setra and Scania)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 300+ original terminals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used Buses Market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Cockpits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers might review you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ radio stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highway Toll roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic traffic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weather &gt; Rain, snow and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Bus sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic host service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 25 language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely realistic Coach Bus Simulator. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude8d A completely realistic bus simulation!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=606 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/022709c1d3be92fc0a44cddcb79a1927.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/587bd2c60dcaa0ceec75c5aa2b747849.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most played mobile simulation game in the world, <strong>Bus Simulator : Ultimate</strong>, PC version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 Official Mercedes-Benz, Setra and Scania licensed buses are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the greatest bus company ever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most downloaded simulation bus game by over 350+ million users! Establish your bus company and become the largest bus corporation in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>United States, United Kingdom, China, Canada, Russia, Germany, Italy, France, Spain, Netherlands, Turkey, South Korea, Japan, Brazil, Azerbaijan, Belgium, Bulgaria, Saudi Arabia, United Emirates, Czech Republic, Dominican Republic, Indonesia, Philippines, South Africa, India, Hong Kong, Ireland, Israel, Qatar, Malaysia, Thailand, Taiwan and more Realistic city maps and bus stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/ccc2d456391859edf57ff88034e76491.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=726 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/6106859702ea117a6eaf2e9b12900f2d.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While passengers rest at the rest area, you can wash your bus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/2602932fedf364aa47a36e10f883d784.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=726 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/0e7336ef0274d9016da3696a62943910.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will experience real bus driving with highly detailed bus cockpits designed down to the finest detail.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.poster.avif?t=1740660273\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.webm?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/de55946e975e30a31b1efbfff45aa859.mp4?t=1740660273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530280/extras/87bcc2e043f69a0bc38b69e42a810d3a.avif?t=1740660273\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to have offices in many places around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 thousand cities and counties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passenger System will provide Social and Realistic Reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your own business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees and manage your company for maximum profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32+ Amazing Coach Bus (Mercedes-Benz, Setra and Scania)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 300+ original terminals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used Buses Market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Cockpits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers might review you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ radio stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highway Toll roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic traffic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weather &gt; Rain, snow and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Bus sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic host service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 25 language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely realistic Coach Bus Simulator. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude8d A completely realistic bus simulation!</strong></h2>",
